    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A pure data descriptor. No state, no history, no behaviour. Built per-frame by the owning screen, consumed by the renderer.</para>
<para>Also serves as the SSOT for cursor position computation via its static functions. Callers query their own data structures and pass raw values; <ref refid="struct_cursor" kindref="compound">Cursor</ref> computes and returns a <ref refid="struct_cursor_1_1_position" kindref="compound">Position</ref> without touching any screen state. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
